Method 1
\[
\begin{aligned}
\left(x^{-3}\right)^{7-k}\left(x^{2}\right)^{k} & =x^{-6} \\
x^{-21+3 k} x^{2 k} & =x^{-6} \\
x^{-21+5 k} & =x^{-6} \\
-21+5 k & =-6 \\
5 k & =15 \\
k & =3
\end{aligned}
\]
